        <body>
            <div xml:id="d777">

                <pb facs="0689" n="679" xml:id="pg679"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4–1249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-12T19:00:00-05:00">April 12, 1949—7
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>451. Urtel 750 Apr 12 apparently crossed Deptel 447 Apr 11. Dept concurs ur
                    recommendation remain Nanking for reasons outlined Emb reftel.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
